### ============================================
### LOCALHOST - PLAYLISTS
### ============================================

### 1. Get all playlists (Success 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/playlists

### 2. Get playlist by ID (Success 200) - Jazz Playlist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/6ad1a123a6238671da0fb676

### 3. Create playlist (Success 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Local Test Playlist",
  "description": "Testing the API locally",
  "creator": "Jesus Tortolero",
  "genre": "rock",
  "songs": ["Song 1", "Song 2"],
  "isPublic": true,
  "coverImage": "https://picsum.photos/400/400?random=10"
}

### 4. Update playlist (Success 200) - Jazz Playlist
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/6ad1a123a6238671da0fb676
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jazz for Studying - Local Update"
}

### 5. Delete playlist (Success 200) - "My Awesome Playlist"
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/playlists/6ad6cc95ca7403d6e432f500

### 6. Validation Error (400) - Missing creator and short name
POST http://localhost:3000/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hi",
  "genre": "rock"
}


